*.RW2
*.RAW
*.rw2
*.raw
*.dng
*.tif
*.tiff
*.JPG
*.jpg
*.jpeg
calib/fujify/_*.png
calib/cmp_*.png
calib/val_*.png

# Grain calibration source renders (large; regenerate the chart with gen_grain_chart.py and
